  "title": "The Two Became One: Jesus Christ at the Incarnation",
  "description": "Jesus Christ at the Incarnation: Two distinct, opposite natures united in one person. Jesus Christ in the Resurrection: The two natures became one, sharing the same divine life. By E.H. Jack Sequeira.",
