        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Jesus Christ at the Resurrection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "On the cross, our corporate condemned life died eternally "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "in Christ",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " [the wages of sin, see 2 Corinthians 5:14]. In the resurrection, God gave the human race the eternal life of His Son [1 John 5:11]. All that we are, as a result of the Fall, Christ was made at the incarnation; that through His life, death, and resurrection all that He is we were made "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "in Him",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " [2 Corinthians 5:17]. This constitutes the good news of the gospel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "BY NATURE WE ARE:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Spiritually dead, but "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "in Christ",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " were made spiritually alive [Eph. 2:5] "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Sinners, but "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "in Christ",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " were made righteous [2 Cor. 5:21] "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Sinful, but "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "in Christ",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " were made holy and blameless [Eph. 1:4] "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Condemned, but "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "in Christ",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " were justified [Rom. 5:18] "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Sons of man, but "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "in Christ",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " were made sons of God [1 Jn. 3:1] "
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Hell bound, but "
          },
